  "narrative": "<h3 class=\"story-subheading\">Short impact summary</h3>\n<p class=\"story-text\">Praxishandbuch Digitale Projekte in der Sozialen Arbeit (2024), published by Beltz Juventa, has been cited 5 times. Beyond that, it has been downloaded 1,542 times.</p>\n<h3 class=\"story-subheading\">Full narrative</h3>\n<p class=\"story-text\">Praxishandbuch Digitale Projekte in der Sozialen Arbeit by Stefanie Neumaier, Madeleine Dörr and Edeltraud Botzum was published by Beltz Juventa in 2024. Conceptually, the work connects to Political science.</p>\n<p class=\"story-text\">OpenAlex records 5 citations. Citations peaked in 2026 with 4 citing works. Notable citing venues include DiMe-Sozial | Soziale Arbeit Medien und Digitalisierung, Anatolian journal of obstetrics and gynecology research. and merz | medien + erziehung. The citing works include 2 journal articles and 1 book chapter. They come from 2 countries, led by Germany and Turkey.</p>\n<p class=\"story-text\">It has been downloaded 1,542 times via OAPEN. Its subject matter aligns with Reduced inequalities among the Sustainable Development Goals.</p>",
